# Redirects for Cloudflare Pages
# Automatically applied by the optimization script

# Redirect www to non-www - DISABLED (handled by Cloudflare Rules instead)
# https://www.paulthery.com/* https://paulthery.com/:splat 301
# https://www.paulthery.studio/* https://paulthery.studio/:splat 301

# Redirect HTTP to HTTPS (usually handled by Cloudflare)
http://paulthery.com/* https://paulthery.com/:splat 301
http://paulthery.studio/* https://paulthery.studio/:splat 301

# No redirect from the root. Art direction opens there anyway - main.js treats
# '/' and '/artdirection' alike - so sending the browser on to /artdirection
# only changed the address bar. The root keeps its own clean URL.
#
# Note for whoever adds one later: a source qualified by domain
# (https://paulthery.com/) is NOT honoured here. It deploys without complaint
# and does nothing. Bare paths only.

# Redirects for old URLs (if necessary)
# /old-page /new-page 301

# Redirect for files not found to the home page
/404.html / 404
